` from the entry point. This is the only `unsafe` block, narrowly scoped, single-threaded, and guarded against dangling.\n\n7. **Comparators** — `compare_x/y/z/size_t` use the same `>`/`<`/`==` ordering as the C `CMP` macro.\n\n**Verification:** Built with `cargo build` — only stylistic warnings (e.g., the `space` struct name is lowercase per the immutable spec). Ran a port of `c_src/run_test.c` as an integration test against all six search cases (none, one, all on borders, all beyond, front slice, back slice, and the explicit box search) — all passed — then removed the temporary test file as it isn't part of the project layout."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":225,"cache_read_input_tokens":42432,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":225,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2f1139e5-ff64-4269-8b53-50d777235080","uuid":"4ebb3751-5bc5-436b-b8ab-b5601afe0f19"}
